OL,3,GNEWSAGlasgow City Council at 'critical'
OL,4,Apoint over #110m budget gap
OL,5,
OL,6,FGlasgow City Council is facing a
OL,7,F"critical" point in a bid to turn
OL,8,Faround its finances, Scotland's public
OL,9,Fspending watchdog has warned.
OL,11,FThe Accounts Commission said "robust
OL,12,Foversight" was needed to tackle a #110m
OL,13,Fbudget gap spanning the next two
OL,14,Ffinancial years.
OL,16,FIts report found that other potential
OL,17,Fcosts, over an ongoing equal pay
OL,18,Fdispute and the rising of cost of
OL,19,Fhomelessness, could add to the budget
OL,20,Fpressures.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,422,420,260,160,0,100
