OL,3,GNEWSAGlasgow City Council at 'critical'
OL,4,Apoint over #110m budget gap
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe commission said that decisions over
OL,7,Fthe next few months would have a
OL,8,F"significant bearing" on the council's
OL,9,Ffuture financial sustainability.
